    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A TWISTED SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human intellect has withered. In this bizarre world, every child is born from the same mother, and rulebreakers are flushed straight down the toilet. Journey through the world of Yonder and uncover the unsettling secrets behind its distorted society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/103b6a1047e2e6bcc2aae63e84b1bba1.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open ancient eggs scattered across the wild to uncover rare weapons, unique upgrades, and game-changing perks. Survival depends on building an unstoppable arsenal as you fight your way deeper into the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/f9b009a48073d3e91acd43e3d155b11c.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EARN REPUTATION WITH FAKE COMPLIMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The people never forget your sins, but they\u2019re easily swayed by flattery. Offer fake compliments to climb the ranks of society. Only at the top can you earn intimacy, but fall too far and you\u2019ll become the target of those you once tried to impress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/83dda7d8129c151fd99a320314c92f18.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div><br><br><strong>A WILD STORY WITH UNEXPECTED TURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare yourself for a story full of shocking twists and unexpected turns. As you venture through the world of Yonder. The key to survival? Friendship. Gather a  group of allies, each with their own skills and stories, as you face the evil Fergooson together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/d13fad83cf21a2deab5885d452fbeed4.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A TWISTED SOCIETY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Human intellect has withered. In this bizarre world, every child is born from the same mother, and rulebreakers are flushed straight down the toilet. Journey through the world of Yonder and uncover the unsettling secrets behind its distorted society.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/103b6a1047e2e6bcc2aae63e84b1bba1.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>FIND UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open ancient eggs scattered across the wild to uncover rare weapons, unique upgrades, and game-changing perks. Survival depends on building an unstoppable arsenal as you fight your way deeper into the underworld.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/f9b009a48073d3e91acd43e3d155b11c.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EARN REPUTATION WITH FAKE COMPLIMENTS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The people never forget your sins, but they\u2019re easily swayed by flattery. Offer fake compliments to climb the ranks of society. Only at the top can you earn intimacy, but fall too far and you\u2019ll become the target of those you once tried to impress.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/83dda7d8129c151fd99a320314c92f18.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div><br><br><strong>A WILD STORY WITH UNEXPECTED TURNS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Prepare yourself for a story full of shocking twists and unexpected turns. As you venture through the world of Yonder. The key to survival? Friendship. Gather a  group of allies, each with their own skills and stories, as you face the evil Fergooson together.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1078340/extras/d13fad83cf21a2deab5885d452fbeed4.avif?t=1749458759\" /></div></p>",
    "short_description": "The only roguelite where your only form of public transport is getting flushed in a toilet. Gain reputation with intellectually struggling humans to get a chance at intimacy with the only female in town and fight your way through the underworld to uncover the secrets of this twisted society!",
